@startuml task_topic_membership_policy_rebuild
!pragma layout smetana
title 标式化投影任务: topic_membership_policy_rebuild
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

database "Outbox 成员/政治" as OUTBOX
participant "任务投影器" as PROJECTOR
database "类型任务" as TASKS
database "题目捕捉" as CLAIM
participant "工人机" as WORKER
database "最近的会员/政策" as POLICY
database "MESSAGE_PLACEMENT" as PLACEMENTS
database "USER_TOPIC_BINDING\nUSER_MESSAGE_BINDING" as BINDINGS
database "Downstream outbox exact scopes" as FOLLOWUPS
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENTS
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISPATCHER
actor "客户端" as Client

OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : 记录的会员/政策事件
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable topic_membership_policy_rebuild\n(outbox_event_uuid, scope=topic)\nunique derivation; 没有 coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : 显而易见的主题领域
WORKER -> CLAIM : 独占的 (项目,主题)
WORKER -> POLICY : active membership + expected generation
WORKER -> PLACEMENTS : 阅读显式的位置
note right of PLACEMENTS
  按 MESSAGE.created_at DESC:
  14:20 -> 14:19 -> 14:15
end note
group 一个 DB transaction
  loop 影响到的用户/位置
    WORKER -> BINDINGS : conditional upsert 在 generation equality;\nstale task = no-op
  end
  WORKER -> FOLLOWUPS : immutable outbox events exact scopes:\nuser-stream / user-topic / user-folder
  WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready topic-scoped rows
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : 让我们安全地释放
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : 稳定的记录
DISPATCHER -> Client : 发送 / 重复 / 播放

note over TASKS,BINDINGS
  这就是 exact topic-scope protocol 服务于单独的
  TASK_KIND topic_state_projection 为了 ready topic.updated;
  authoritative TOPIC.is_done 只有同步命令才能改变.
  Revoke active=false + generation++ 时间同步;
  stale rows 没有允许访问, cleanup 没有 security boundary.
  Topic worker shared rows 他没有写.
  Lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper 必须.
end note

@enduml
